  "changelog": "This Skill wraps the core APIs of Tencent Cloud SES and provides the following capabilities:\n \u2981Domain management: query, create, and verify sender domains.\n \u2981Address management: query and create sender addresses.\n \u2981Email sending: supports both template-based sending and custom content sending, with advanced options such as CC, BCC, attachments, and unsubscribe links.\n \u2981Status query: query email delivery and receipt status.\n \u2981Template management: create, update, and delete email templates.\n \u2981DNS diagnostics: check SPF, DKIM, DMARC, and MX records, detect CNAME conflicts, and verify global DNS propagation.",
